WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.360
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.000
No claiming to have the infinity stones!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.080
No matter what Dr. Bright might say, his&nbsp;
amulet does not contain the Soul Gem.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.400
As far as we know, it does not exist. Nor&nbsp;
do any of the rest of the infinity stones,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.920
or the infinity gauntlet. So if Dr.&nbsp;
Bright glares at you for being annoying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.400
and snaps his fingers, you have nothing&nbsp;
to worry about. You'll be perfectly fine.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.120
And we'll stop letting Dr.&nbsp;
Bright watch Marvel movies.

